[00:16.14]
[00:27.37]Wouldn't it be nice to take a walk on some pure white sand
{"漫步在纯白沙滩上该有多美好"}
[00:34.09]Gaze at the horizon without living in fear
{"凝视地平线而无需活在恐惧中"}
[00:40.78]Wouldn't it be sweet to watch the sun curve down meet the waves
{"看夕阳弯入海浪该有多甜蜜"}
[00:48.05]And taste the ocean spray
{"品尝海风的咸涩"}
[00:51.22]And realize we'd been living as slaves
{"才惊觉我们一直活得如同奴隶"}
[00:59.19]
[00:59.23]We've got to learn to get back, get back
{"我们必须学会回归 回归"}
[01:02.71]But is it worth the price of our soul
{"但这代价是否值得出卖灵魂"}
[01:05.95]You know you had to kill her, kill her
{"你明知必须杀了她 杀了她"}
[01:09.44]Oh my dirty hands it never fades
{"啊 我染血的双手永难洗净"}
[01:13.26]
[01:13.27]And if we get out, get out
{"若能逃出生天 逃出生天"}
[01:15.78]I'll think about the price of our soul
{"我会思考灵魂的代价"}
[01:19.05]We've got to learn to live free, live free
{"我们必须学会自由地活 自由地活"}
[01:22.63]We'll live a life without barricades
{"我们将过上毫无阻碍的生活"}
